WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Gentle waves lapping across Manila Bay under clear tropical skies]

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
A Philippine Navy vessel glides across the historic waters of Manila Bay,
once the busy anchorage of the Manila–Acapulco galleon trade.

00:11.000 --> 00:17.000
Along the distant shoreline rises the silhouette of Metro Manila,
connecting centuries of maritime heritage with a modern capital city.
